body:
Dear creators of Habitica! Your application for Apple devices is, probably, great.... But I ABSOLUTELY CANNOT USE IT because EVERY TIME when I&#39;ve tried to used it, it told me on FREAKING WHITE SCREEN - &#34;open AppStore and update me or I will not work&#34;.... But I have and old device with old iOS, and I can&#39;t upgrade it because of my business reasons.... And now, because of you all, I really hate programmers making apps locked on version of OS, doesn&#39;t matter, new or old. I have a really important app that was locked on iOS 8, and I&#39;ve had many troubles before made it work on iOS 9. So, finally, I updated my old 8 iOS, and, firstly after that, started Habitica, because I really hoped that it should work fine on iOS 9... And what? WHITE SCREEN AGAIN!!!  

Please, just make the legacy version for old iOS, don&#39;t be foolish... Yo losing that part of clients that using old devices and software. And do not tell me anything about your website, because it only tells me &#34;just install the app&#34;

...NOT WORKING APP FOR ME!
